OL,3,GNEWSA'How am I meant to plan anything?'
OL,4,AThe frustration of a seven-month
OL,5,Adriving test backlog
OL,6,
OL,7,FMegan Hart hoped learning to drive
OL,8,Fwould make life easier before the
OL,9,Farrival of her new baby.
OL,11,FInstead, the 38-year-old has found
OL,12,Fherself caught in one of Scotland's
OL,13,Flongest driving test backlogs, with no
OL,14,Fguarantee she will be offered a
OL,15,Fpractical test before her due date in
OL,16,FApril.
OL,18,F"It's going to become impossible," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
