OL,3,GNEWSA'How am I meant to plan anything?'
OL,4,AThe frustration of a seven-month
OL,5,Adriving test backlog
OL,6,
OL,7,FMegan lives in Arbroath where waiting
OL,8,Ftimes for tests reached almost seven
OL,9,Fmonths in October, making it the
OL,10,Fsecond-longest wait in the UK.
